//janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今回は最近のまあやの1日を書きたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝6時に起床♪\nそれから、おうちの事を済ませて学校〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（満員電車にはだいぶんなれたよ...\nカバンは持ってなくても落ちないくらいの満員電車...笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お弁当の時間になる前に\nチャイムがなったらダッシュで友達と購買にパンを買いに行く〜！\n（購買のおばちゃんは、まあやの名前を覚えてくれてる...照...嬉しい...）(//∇//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校終わったらレッスン♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなメンバーとレッスン♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わっておうちに帰って直ぐにお風呂〜の前に...\nお母さんに帰ったよ電話をする\n（電話しないと心配で寝れないらしいので...笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯機を回してお風呂入って、出てきて洗濯ほして、アイロンして、少し勉強〜\n明日の支度をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前に皆からのコメントを読んで♪\n幸せな気持ちで\n「明日も頑張るぞー!!」って思って...爆睡!!(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです\n学校はテストが多いので、前より勉強するようになったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ〜ん!!\n★前回のラーメンの集計結果発表です★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１位→豚骨\n２位→味噌\n３位→醤油\n４位→塩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１位と２位の差は一票だけだったよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って書いてたら又ラーメン食べたくなるよね〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなラーメン屋さんの名前を教えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜質問返し〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★みなみは元気にしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・してるよ〜！またまた可愛くなってるから会ったらビックリとドキュンだよ♪\n昨日みなみとさゆにゃんとキャプテンとでレッスン終わりに焼き肉行ったよ！語りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/24/5546793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★なーちゃんとどんな話をするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーーめっちゃ普通の話...笑\nなぁちゃんが新曲ガールズルールの歌にめっちゃまあやの名前入れてきたり、童謡とか一緒に歌ったりしてる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★広島ラーメンとかあるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・それはしならいんだけど、尾道ラーメンはあるよ！\nコメントにも書いてくれてたけど、これがスゴく美味しいんだよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★豚骨ラーメン好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・うん!!好きだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★なに味のかき氷がすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・レモンかなぁ...でも抹茶も好き\nでも気分によって色々\n（食べたい〜(^〇^)）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★録音会に行った俺の事覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・もちろん♪来てくれたひと皆〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも沢山の質問ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとななみんが月9に出るよ〜(^〇^)\n楽しみだから絶対に録画しとこう〜っと\n皆も忘れずにねー\nBYE"}],"source":"archive"}